flowchart TD
    IDE[IDE agent follows instructions] --> P[Read strategy and linked critic preview via CLI or MCP]
    P --> G{Successful plan, matching critic, current sources?}
    G -->|No| B[Block approval]
    G -->|Yes| H[Human reviews hypotheses, gaps and critic concerns]
    H --> C[Explicit command with owner, resolution, scope and preview hash]
    C --> T[PostgreSQL transaction locks and rechecks pinned inputs]
    T -->|Changed| B
    T -->|Unchanged| R[One immutable internal approval receipt]
    R --> REPLAY[Same command returns same receipt]
    R --> E[Export rechecks current inputs]
    E -->|Changed or stale| X[Keep historical receipt; block export]
    E -->|Unchanged| F[UTF-8 Markdown and JSON contents with SHA-256]
    F --> N[Internal review only; no publication or customer promises]
